{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABANDON ALL HOPE</strong></h2> You wake up to find yourself in the depths of Hell, surrounded by an endless sea of tortured souls. As a low-rank demon, your job is to supply Satan with Slaves. But deep down, you know there's <strong>another way out...</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR DEMON!</strong></h2>Each demon has a different skill set.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428680/extras/gif1.gif?t=1703865174\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INVADE EARTH!</strong></h2>Get to Jerusalem to retrieve a bone from Jesus' remains.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428680/extras/gif3.gif?t=1703865174\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AWAKEN LONG-DEAD FOES</strong></h2>Gather resources, build your base, and train more demons!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428680/extras/movie_015_SteamEditted.gif?t=1703865174\" /><br><br>With the help of your fellow demons(<i>other players</i>), you begin to build your own kingdom in the shadows, preparing for the ultimate battle for supremacy against the Devil and his minions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EPIC GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ever changing world. You don't know what the terrain will be down there. <br></li><li>Co-op or PVP. It's not easy managing a kingdom in the depths of Hell. Split work with your friends.<br></li><li>Terrain matters, so make sure to carefully plan attacks.<br></li><li>Tweak the Rules of the game by signing secret contracts with the Devil.<br></li><li>Recruit notable figures from history.<br></li><li>Gather prayers.<br></li><li>Demons have counters. Use them wisely!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MODES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Single-player story.<br></li><li>Co-op story.<br></li><li>Team Deathmatch.<br></li><li>Survival.</li></ul><br>Get ready to immerse yourself. Claim your rightful place as the ruler of the Infernal Kingdom, and show the Devil who's really in charge. The souls of the damned are counting on you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ALL IN MULTIPLAYER!</strong></h2>Each Team has shared resources, buildings, and an army.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428680/extras/gif2.gif?t=1703865174\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2428680?t=1703865174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2428680?t=1703865174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1703865174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1703865174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"If you ask some of your Slaves, they may mention the real reasons why they end up in Hell. "},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABANDON ALL HOPE</strong></h2> You wake up to find yourself in the depths of Hell, surrounded by an endless sea of tortured souls. As a low-rank demon, your job is to supply Satan with Slaves. But deep down, you know there's <strong>another way out...</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR DEMON!</strong></h2>Each demon has a different skill set.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428680/extras/gif1.gif?t